  (text "This is a development board for producing a working LCD Portable\nmotherboard. It uses currently available chips where possible and\nsome PLCC footprints to keep the board small. It has a Programmable\nCPLD and It has lots of RAM and ROM and a VDC video system using a\ndual-port RAM that allows clocking the CPU and VIDEO systems\nindependantly. It includes CLCD IO for IEC, centronics, barcode and\nreal-time clock."
    (at 15.24 351.79 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 553eb485-f371-40f5-a6a0-79f00473ec31)
  )
  (text "DIN Connector" (at 561.34 163.195 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 56802899-5b37-4632-b5ad-496e99b74082)
  )
