  )
  (text "\n- uMMF Altera MAX CPLD\n- 65C02 CPU.\n- Video uses DPRAM for 80 col or extended modes.\n- Character ROM size increased.\n- TTL Serial for Bluetooth/WiFi\n- Does not implement MODEM\n- Does not implement Battery backup\n- The keyboard uses an IDC connector that matches the compantion\n  MX keyboard pcb, but also has headers for ROW, COL, MOD groups.\n- The keyboard is for the REV1 (Bil's prototype) which is different\n  than the released REV2 schematics.\n- Internal headers for ports\n- LCD firmware will need to be patched to support VDC.\n- The original LCD panel is not available so we will\n  use an RGBI output to a modern VGA/HDMI panel\n  (some adapter may be required, unless the VDC can be\n  adapted to output a VGA compatible signal)"
    (at 14.605 394.97 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d92bc81a-cab1-4a1a-9d75-265341390522)
  )
  (text "GRAPHOPT select ALT Font-\nFONTOPT select upper -\nor lower 32K"
    (at 215.9 304.165 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.54 1.54)) (justify right bottom))
    (uuid da0ac3a9-6cbf-4cf8-ab72-94ede8ae573e)
  )
  (text "RING\nCENTR STB" (at 434.34 213.995 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.56 1.56)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid da49ee4d-748e-4488-ac8f-7b1732fb5cd7)
  )
  (text "ADDRESS lines (A7-A15) are\nused to generate\nEXTENDED ADDRESS (MA10-MA19)\nlines to MEMORY and I/O."
    (at 87.63 146.685 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.58 1.58)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid db495163-a33d-4cfa-a66d-4af8d2c3e9cb)
